title: The note under the Commit button floats over the panel with a close button, and a good one goes away by itself after about six seconds
folders: git-changes
limit: 60
forbid-log: WARN.*script
forbid-log: script: ignoring
expect-file: git-changes/.git/logs/HEAD :: commit: note then gone

wait 3000
left changes
wait 800
git stage src/steps.rs
wait 1200
git commit note then gone
wait 1500
mark note-showing
wait 450
wait 2000
mark note-still-there
wait 450
wait 6000
mark note-gone
wait 450
quit
